          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained higher global oil prices feed into inflation and higher real discount rates and operating cost expectations, compressing valuation multiples on growth assets including publicly and privately held AI companies." />
