          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in drone and missile strikes near ports, industrial zones and logistics corridors raises perceived operational and insurance risk for regional projects, prompting VCs, banks and corporate investors to pull back or slow new capital allocations to AI firms and infrastructure in the affected region." />
