          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising rates of attacks on ships and port facilities cause cargo damage, detention for inspections, insurance-driven rerouting and port closures that directly reduce on‑hand and in‑transit quantities of critical components bound for US–China tech supply chains." />
