          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Acute interruptions in energy commodity flows lead governments to impose or more rigorously apply border measures and export restrictions to protect domestic supply, thereby increasing tariff and related enforcement intensity on affected product flows between major trading partners." />
