          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid corporate rerouting and relocation of sourcing concentrates previously dispersed container and breakbulk flows through alternative straits and ports, producing immediate backlogs and queuing at those chokepoints." />
