          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Faster firm-level reconfiguration of supply chains away from standard, heavily policed routes increases use of smaller ships, alternative ports and opaque transshipment nodes that are harder for interdiction forces to monitor, reducing the practical effectiveness of any blockade or interdiction campaign." />
